# Build a reusable Document Rendering Engine

The purpose of this phase is to generate professional documents from templates.

The first supported document is:

```
INVOICE
```

Future documents:

```
QUOTE

PURCHASE_ORDER

CREDIT_NOTE

RECEIPT

DELIVERY_NOTE
```

The implementation must be generic and must not tightly couple the rendering engine to invoices.

