# Technology Requirements

Use:

## HTML Rendering

```
Thymeleaf
```

## PDF Generation

```
OpenHTMLToPDF
```

The flow should be:

```
Business Entity

↓

Document Context

↓

Thymeleaf Template

↓

HTML

↓

OpenHTMLToPDF

↓

PDF byte[]

↓

File Upload Module
```

