# 12. Document Generation Service

Create:

```
DocumentGenerationService
```

Responsibilities:

Coordinate the whole process.

Flow:

```
Receive document request

↓

Load entity

↓

Resolve template

↓

Build DocumentContext

↓

Resolve renderer

↓

Generate HTML

↓

Generate PDF

↓

Store PDF using File Module

↓

Save GeneratedDocument

↓

Return result
```

