# 13. Invoice Integration

Implement:

```
InvoiceDocumentService
```

This is the bridge between Invoice module and Document module.

Responsibilities:

```
generateInvoicePdf(invoiceId)
```

It should:

* load invoice
* select invoice template
* create context
* generate PDF

The Document module should not know InvoiceRepository exists.

